BT 1 0 0 1 0 49 Tm /F1 11 Tf 15 TL 1.070182 Tw (Traditional photo editing tools such as Adobe Photoshop or mobile filter applications require) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.225471 Tw (manual selection and retouching of each blemish, which is time-consuming and demands) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.392471 Tw (professional skill. Generic beauty filters often over-smooth the entire face, removing natural) Tj T* 0 Tw (skin pores and altering facial features, resulting in an unnatural "plastic" appearance.) Tj T* ET
Q
