BT 1 0 0 1 0 79 Tm /F1 11 Tf 15 TL .675918 Tw (Existing automated solutions face several limitations: \(1\) Rule-based HSV thresholding alone) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.318706 Tw (produces noisy masks and fails on varied skin tones; \(2\) Simple inpainting methods cannot) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.815418 Tw (handle severe cystic acne; \(3\) GAN-based approaches without identity preservation may) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.590471 Tw (change the person's facial structure; \(4\) Cloud-only solutions lack offline training capability;) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.574942 Tw (and \(5\) Most commercial apps do not expose their underlying ML pipeline for academic or) Tj T* 0 Tw (customization purposes.) Tj T* ET
Q
