BT 1 0 0 1 0 79 Tm 4.972648 Tw 15 TL /F2 11 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Training subsystem \(implemented locally\):) Tj /F1 11 Tf ( Acne images in dataset/Acne/Acne/ are) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.057782 Tw (processed by utils/mask_generator.py using HSV colour thresholding to produce binary masks) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.616471 Tw (in dataset/masks/ \(413 masks generated\). A U-Net model \(models/unet.py\) is trained via) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.887471 Tw (training/train_unet.py for 50 epochs on an RTX 3050 GPU, saving checkpoints/unet.pth. A) Tj T* 0 Tw 5.320118 Tw (StarGAN generator \(models/stargan.py\) is trained on Google Colab using acne and) Tj T* 0 Tw (CelebA-HQ images, saving checkpoints/generator \(1\).pth.) Tj T* ET
