BT 1 0 0 1 0 94 Tm .819932 Tw 15 TL /F2 11 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Web inference subsystem \(currently deployed\):) Tj /F1 11 Tf ( app.py runs a Flask server on port 5000.) Tj T* 0 Tw 6.996576 Tw (The /api/process_image endpoint receives a base64-encoded image, passes it to) Tj T* 0 Tw 5.584523 Tw (AcneRemovalPipeline in inference/pipeline.py, which calls the CodeFormer model on) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.226471 Tw (Replicate \(model ID: sczhou/codeformer\). The restored image is returned as base64 JPEG.) Tj T* 0 Tw .700026 Tw (Optional modules \227 models/identity_preservation.py and models/gfpgan_enhancer.py \227 are) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.010227 Tw (implemented for the full local pipeline described in Readme.md but are not wired into the) Tj T* 0 Tw (current CodeFormer-based inference path.) Tj T* ET
